# Unslop — TA queue + student asks (visual only)

Scope: `TaWorkspace.jsx`, `StudentAsksPage.jsx`, tokens in `styles.css`.
No other pages. No prop/hook/API/router changes. No new deps.

## Tokens (reuse existing theme)
- Colors: `--theme-ink/forest/deep/mist/sand/surface` and `aui-*` from `@theme`.
- Type: `--font-sans` (Source Sans 3), `--font-display` (Source Serif 4) only.
- Radius: keep `rounded-lg` / `rounded-xl` on interactive cards; no new pill clusters or multi-shadows.
- Spacing: `gap-3`/`gap-4` / `mt-3` rhythm; no one-off magic margins.

## Copy (plain campus voice)
- Glossary names: Ask Triage, Help Coach, Quiet ask.
- Cut AI tells: "AI-powered", "smart draft", empty-state emoji, hype verbs.
- Buttons: verb + object ("Claim ask", "Send reply", "Ask for help").

## TA queue
- Hierarchy: queue list → selected ask → actions. Demote Help Coach chrome; keep controls usable.
- Status pills stay functional; no extra badge rows or decorative icon strips.

## Student asks
- Stage timeline readable; less dashed-box / muted microcopy.
- Empty state: one sentence + one CTA.

## Forbidden
- Non-interactive cards, layout rewrites, dark-mode experiments, purple glow.
- Changing fetch/auth/queue filters or Help Coach API payloads.

## Interaction and craft
1. Instant press feedback on primary actions: use an :active opacity change only, no scale, no delayed or click-only chrome.
2. Keep the spatial map fixed: queue list, selected ask, and actions always appear in the same places.
3. Simplicity over chrome: one obvious primary action per view; demote Help Coach and secondary copy.
4. Labels name the outcome ("Claim ask", "Send reply"). No vague "Submit" or "Continue".
5. Honor prefers-reduced-motion. Add no springs, animation libraries or gesture libraries.
6. Craft: keep the gap-3/gap-4 rhythm, and remove leftover dashed boxes and muted filler lines.
